{"UnknownPackage":13,"python":81,"deb":622,"binary":9,"go-module":864,"rpm":25}}},"notes":{"linuxserver":"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-zen/compare/1.24.1b-ls10...1.24.2b-ls11","upstream":"# Zen Stable Release\n\n\n## Security\n- https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/security/advisories/mfsa2026-125/\n\n## New Features\n- Updated to Firefox 159.0.1\n- Added pause context menu button for the downloads section\n- The urlbar now has a bit of transparency for a more modern look.\n- The Picture-in-Picture player now has a playback speed setting, with options ranging from 0.25x to 2.0x speed. The setting appears only when the player window is medium-sized or larger.\n- Pages saved as PDF now make mathematical content (MathML) accessible to assistive technology such as screen readers.\n- Websites that repeatedly ask to handle email (mailto:) and other links can now be blocked with a new “Never allow” button, and blocked sites can be managed in Settings.\n- Zen now plays Matroska (MKV) files with FLAC, MP3, or PCM audio.\n- WebGL content on macOS is now rendered using Apple's Metal graphics API, which can improve performance on some sites.\n\n## Fixes\n- Improved performance for boosts color tinting.\n- Fixed the first character typed into the address bar or search bar sometimes being lost when typing quickly right after clicking into it.\n- Fixed Zen freezing for several seconds when signing in to intranet sites that use NTLM or Kerberos (Negotiate) authentication.\n- Fixed double-tapping or long-pressing a word to select it, and tapping to place the cursor, not working near the cursor in text fields.\n- Fixed links opened in the background from other apps on macOS, such as RSS readers, bringing Zen to the foreground.\n- Fixed downloaded files on macOS sometimes opening in the wrong application instead of the default one set in Finder.\n- Fixed simultaneous downloads on macOS never finishing when Zen is set to ask where to save files. Only the first file showed a save dialog.\n- Restored meaningful filenames and the usual save workflow for PDFs opened in Preview from the macOS print dialog.\n- More bug fixes and improvements.\n\n## Changes\n- The address bar context menu now shows \"Paste and Search\" instead of \"Paste and Go\" when the copied text is a search term rather than a web address.\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/releases/tag/1.24.2b"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIES_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*","SELKIES_RATE_CONTROL_MODE=crf,cbr","SHELL=/bin/bash","__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK=0","TITLE=Zen","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","PIXELFLUX_WAYLAND=true"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp","3001/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":true,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.2b-ls11.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.2b-ls11/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.2b-ls11/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.2b-ls11/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.2b-ls11/packages.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-p